<title>USA: Medical Laser breaks off acquisition talks.</title>
<headline>Medical Laser breaks off acquisition talks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Laser Technologies said it ended its talks to be acquired by R.F. Management Corp because the companies were not able to agree on financial terms.</p>
<p>Medical Laser in November said it agreed to be acquired by R.F. for a combination of cash and stock, although it did not disclose specific terms.</p>
<p>Medical Laser has &quot;explored every option&quot; with R.F., said Medical Laser Chairman Michael O'Shea. No more talks are expected between the companies, he said.</p>
</text>
